OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 30 JAN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gclassical soundscape, bookended
OL,7,     Gwith music inspired by
OL,8,     GShakespeare and his wife.
OL,9,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,10,     GRichard Balcombe conducts the BBC
OL,11,     GConcert Orchestra in classic film
OL,12,     Gscores from British cinema, from
OL,13,     GChichester Festival Theatre.
OL,14,     GPresented by Petroc Trelawny.
OL,15,G2145FThe Essay: On Disappointment
OL,16,     GRachel Cooke confesses to being
OL,17,     Gdisappointed on what she thought
OL,18,     Gwas going to be the trip of a
OL,19,     Glifetime, and wonders if that
OL,20,     Gsays more about her or about the
OL,21,     Gholiday.
