OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 30 JAN
OL,4,G2200FLate Junction
OL,5,     GVerity Sharp presents another
OL,6,     Ggloriously unpredictable late-
OL,7,     Gnight sonic journey, including
OL,8,     Gnear-dystopian early gospel and
OL,9,     Gthe sounds of a house in the
OL,10,     Gprocess of disappearing.
OL,11,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,12,     GFour legends of British jazz are
OL,13,     Glive in session for 'Round
OL,14,     GMidnight with a new project.
OL,15,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,16,     GThe Halle family of orchestra and
OL,17,     Gchoirs perform James MacMillan's
OL,18,     GTimotheus, Bacchus and Cecilia
OL,19,     Gand Mahler's life-affirming Fifth
OL,20,     GSymphony. Penny Gore presents.
